seed-b-frontend/src/app/features/catalog/sort-select/sort-select.html
seed-b-frontend/src/app/features/catalog/sort-select/sort-select.spec.ts
```

Geänderte Dateien:
```
seed-b-backend.Api/Application/CatalogService.cs       # GetProductsAsync um sortBy/sortDirection erweitert
seed-b-backend.Api/Controllers/ProductsController.cs    # GetProducts um sortBy/sortDirection-Query-Parameter erweitert
seed-b-backend.Tests/Application/CatalogServiceTests.cs # SeedProductsWithOffers + 6 neue Tests

seed-b-frontend/src/app/features/catalog/catalog-api.service.ts    # getProducts um Sortierparameter erweitert
seed-b-frontend/src/app/features/catalog/catalog-api.service.spec.ts
seed-b-frontend/src/app/features/catalog/product-list/product-list.ts    # Sortier-State + SortSelect-Integration
seed-b-frontend/src/app/features/catalog/product-list/product-list.html  # <app-sort-select> eingefügt
